      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.37,
      "end_seconds": 10.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Yes come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.48,
      "end_seconds": 15.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Well, doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.07,
      "end_seconds": 27.66,
      "duration_seconds": 10.59,
      "text": "Well I've been having pins and needles in my hands and feet. I did try to ignore it for a a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.06,
      "end_seconds": 32.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "what's the timeline when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.98,
      "end_seconds": 41.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.48,
      "text": "okay uh so so probably nearly five years yeah i told my wife I'd come today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.62,
      "end_seconds": 45.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.11,
      "end_seconds": 67.09,
      "duration_seconds": 20.98,
      "text": "it feels mild to me. As for forgetting words, I honestly can't say when that began. It It might have been last month or the month before. I was feeling very tired at one point, but that's gone now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.42,
      "end_seconds": 87.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.09,
      "end_seconds": 102.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "okay this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.7,
      "end_seconds": 132.82,
      "duration_seconds": 13.12,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 108 over 72 height 173 centimetres. And pulse is 78 beats a minute oxygen saturation is 98 percent weight 65 kilos temp 36.6 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.88,
      "end_seconds": 139.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.41,
      "end_seconds": 144.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "alright, I'll come back to the numbers"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.9,
      "end_seconds": 157.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "any loss of vision, diarrhoea, bladder problems or rash at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.29,
      "end_seconds": 161.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.82,
      "end_seconds": 164.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.25,
      "end_seconds": 166.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.67,
      "end_seconds": 179.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Any surgery in the the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.88,
      "end_seconds": 184.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I had a a varicose vein procedure last year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.1,
      "end_seconds": 190.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "So, any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.22,
      "end_seconds": 197.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "I have acid reflux. I have diabetes, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.2,
      "end_seconds": 205.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "Okay I can see acid reflux and diabetes in your file as well. And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.37,
      "end_seconds": 210.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.41,
      "end_seconds": 213.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.32,
      "end_seconds": 220.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.6,
      "end_seconds": 226.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.95,
      "end_seconds": 232.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "Plasters i come out in... well a red itchy rash"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.2,
      "end_seconds": 235.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "let's run through your medicines"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.07,
      "end_seconds": 244.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "text": "Lansoprazole i take it 30 milligrams before breakfast it's Glycomet 500 milligrams twice a day for my sugar"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 245.24,
      "end_seconds": 254.35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the Glycomet was 1000 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.41,
      "end_seconds": 258.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "alright did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.22,
      "end_seconds": 263.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.35,
      "end_seconds": 282.69,
      "duration_seconds": 18.34,
      "text": "From what you've told me, I think we're dealing with symptoms that fit a vitamin B12 deficiency at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and and it may change as we learn more. Another possibility is an under-active thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.28,
      "end_seconds": 287.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.8,
      "end_seconds": 308.96,
      "duration_seconds": 20.16,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like symptoms that fit a vitamin B12 deficiency. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Today I'm not changing anything. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.52,
      "end_seconds": 311.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "that's clear thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
